Game material
No game assets, executables, extracted or decrypted images, generated translations or other
data from F.E.A.R. (Xbox 360 or PC) are distributed here. Tools operate on the user's own copy
and their outputs stay local: .gitignore keeps them out, and tools/audit_repo.py checks every
commit. The shader warm-up lists (port-nx/warmup/, port-files/warmup/) are generated locally
from the user's own files and caches and are not tracked. The private test packages that
tools/steamdeck/make_package.py makes contain game data and programs built from it: they must
never be uploaded anywhere, including as release assets.

